@startuml View Active Banners Sequence Diagram
title UC-BN00 - View List Banners (Client/Public)

actor "Customer" as User
participant "Home/Menu Page" as Frontend
participant ":bannerRoutes" as Routes
participant ":bannerController" as Controller
participant ":bannerService" as Service
participant "Banner\nModel" as Model
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> Frontend: 1. Truy cập Home/Menu theo canteen đã chọn
Frontend -> Routes: 2. GET /api/banners/active?canteenId=...\n(Không cần token)

Routes -> Controller: 3. getActiveBanners(req, res)
Controller -> Service: 4. getActiveBanners(canteenId)

Service -> Service: 5. Build filter\n(isActive=true + điều kiện thời gian hiệu lực)
Service -> Model: 6. find(filter).populate("canteenId").sort({order:1})
Model -> DB: 7. Query banners active
DB --> Model: 8. Danh sách banners
Model --> Service: 9. Banners array
Service --> Controller: 10. Return banners

Controller --> Routes: 11. HTTP 200
Routes --> Frontend: 12. JSON Response\n{ status: "success", results, data: { banners } }

Frontend -> Frontend: 13. Render hero/slider banner
Frontend --> User: 14. Hiển thị banner đang hoạt động

@enduml
